🧪 Team Creation Test Cases (Fansportiz)
Verify that the user can manually create a team to join a contest.
Verify that the system prevents creation of multiple teams with the same name at the same time.
Verify that the auto-pick feature selects all players as per the team creation rules.
Verify that after using auto-pick, the user still needs to manually select captain and vice-captain.
Verify behavior when the user selects captain and vice-captain, then deselects them, and re-selects new ones.
Verify the credit point value for the selected captain is calculated correctly.
Verify the credit point value for the selected vice-captain is calculated correctly.
Verify that the maximum number of players from the same team is restricted to 7 and total players must be 11.
Verify the behavior when a selected vice-captain is later removed from the match lineup by the coach.
Verify that selected player credit points are displayed as per requirements.
Verify that a toast message is displayed upon selecting the 11th and final player for the team.
Verify system behavior when selected players include one who is removed before the match starts.
Verify system behavior when the selected captain is removed before the match starts.
Verify that all player names and their details (role, team, etc.) are displayed correctly.
Verify that newly added players are visible in the player list before the match begins.
Verify the accuracy of team members’ names and their associated details.
Verify that players are correctly associated with their respective team names.
Verify that once the required number of players are selected, remaining players are disabled for further selection.
Verify system behavior when the user selects only 6 players and tries to proceed.
Verify system prevents selection of more than 8 players from the same real-world team.
Verify that clicking on "More than 7 players" button deselects all players as expected.
Verify that the total credit points are deducted correctly after selecting any player.
Verify that the count of selected players (out of 11) updates correctly when players are selected or deselected.
Verify that the “0/11 Players” indicator updates correctly after each selection or removal.
Verify mandatory selection of at least 1 WL (Wicket Keeper).
Verify mandatory selection of 1 to 5 ALLR (All-Rounders).
Verify mandatory selection of 1 to 4 BT (Batsmen).
Verify mandatory selection of at least 1 BWL (Bowler).
Verify system behavior when the user tries to select more than 1 WL player.
Verify system behavior when the user tries to select more than 5 ALLR players.
Verify system behavior when the user tries to select more than 4 BT players.
Verify system behavior when the user tries to select more than 1 BWL player.
Verify that the user can select batsmen from both teams.
Verify that the user can select all-rounders from both teams.
Verify that the user can select 1 wicket keeper from either team.
Verify that the user can select at least 1 bowler from either team.
